   "notes": "Bioreactor mineral glucose medium; base salts/Mg/glucose/cobalt from the target paper's main text, and the full 7-component trace element solution recovered from the directly cited Thorfinnsdottir et al. 2023 (PMC9965072). The bioreactor formulation uses NH4Cl/K2HPO4/NaCl directly (not the 10X Na2HPO4-containing salt solution used for the secondary preculture), so no Na2HPO4 is present. No vitamins are used (defined mineral medium). Trace metals were the missing piece; concentration_mM values are final-in-medium molarities after the 2 mL/L dilution."
